  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The diagram shows two masses, <em>M </em>and <em>m </em>that are connected by a string through a pulley, where <em>M</em> &gt; <em>m</em>. The mass of the string and the friction between the string and the pulley are negligible.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the acceleration of mass M?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{g(M+m)}{M}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{g(M-m)}{M}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{g(M+m)}{M-m}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{g(M-m)}{M+m}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
